Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Introduction", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"311c733c-daf6-457c-b495-95b8691a5068"],

Cell["\<\
Realistic NMR sequences combine RF amplitudes (10^3-10^5 rad/s), O(1) phases, \
and short millisecond/microsecond delays constrained to strictly positive \
domains (tau > 0). Scaling coordinates automatically and supplying exact \
analytical Hessians eliminates ill-conditioning across scales.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"99d97203-a7ab-467c-a7f2-29bbdfd9b2bd"],

Cell["\<\
Enforce positivity with ConstrainPositive -> True | {vars...} or explicit box \
bounds {lb, ub}.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"2d9c5a1a-7187-42be-baf4-139c1963f876"],

Cell["\<\
Unlock second-order solvers (HybridLBFGSNewtonCG, TrustRegionNewtonCG, \
NewtonRFO) on bounded problems via BoundTransform -> \"Sigmoid\" or \"Log\".\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"84ce576e-3670-4cd7-954c-12f46865e976"],

Cell["\<\
Verify analytical gradients and O(K) Hessian-vector products against \
high-accuracy central finite differences.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"24f7dd26-0184-4964-80c4-45b9f748cfe9"],

Cell["\<\
Inspect FuseStaticEvents propagator compression and dependency-slice \
HashTable caching.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ed24ebdd-d54e-4fad-9231-119adea2a707"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Mathematical Background", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"5eb04526-2f63-4dc2-9fa1-1c238bfd05c2"],

Cell["\<\
To handle multi-scale variables (e.g. w ~ 10^3 rad/s alongside tau ~ 10^-3 \
s), RunGeneralOptimizer maps physical parameters x to dimensionless solver \
coordinates theta_i = x_i / m_i ~ O(1) via ParameterScaling -> Automatic. For \
bounded second-order optimization on x in [lb, ub], BoundTransform -> \
\"Sigmoid\" applies x_i(u_i) = lb_i + (ub_i - lb_i) sigma(u_i) (or \"Log\" \
x_i = lb_i + Exp(u_i)) and propagates exact chain-rule derivatives g_u = \
diag(x') g_x and Hessians H_u = diag(x') H_x diag(x') + diag(g_x * x'').\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3e3087e2-6a67-4c5f-92d7-8aa1dab7d90f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Worked Example", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1e553db7-3a07-4005-90ca-ae383655c3d3"],

Cell["\<\
Verify derivatives and optimize (a) bounded 2-spin INEPT delays, (b) a \
6-parameter multi-scale 2-spin sequence (10^-3..10^3), and (c) static fusion \
+ cache telemetry on a 20-event sequence.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"84ab7706-72b8-48f2-a95e-73c1116027c0"],

